{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/807225-question-what-happens-if-a-vampire-drinks-angels-blood","id":807225,"title":"Question What Happens if a vampire drinks Angels blood ?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-01-12T12:51:35-08:00","id":807225,"title":"Question What Happens if a vampire drinks Angels blood ?","content":"Ok so now that the demon book says what happens if a mage drinks demons blood it got me thinking what happens if a vampire drinks angels blood like an exile ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-12T13:03:27-08:00","id":807237,"title":"","content":"Perhaps this is where the Holy Engineers and the Tenth Choir get their abilities.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127694-arcanist-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><b>My Homebrew Hub</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist","name":"Arcanist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-12T13:08:50-08:00","id":807243,"title":"","content":"Well, given the nature of Covers that both angels and demons possess... I'd say nothing more than drinking from a mortal. Boring, perhaps, but thematic for how Covers work. Materialized, obvious angels? I'd go with the same rules as a promethean - half as effective, tastes nasty - plus come under the scrutiny of the God-Machine, possibly using one of the Compromised Conditions. Angels are biomechanical, so their blood isn't quite as pure life energy as you'd like.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-12T14:27:31-08:00","id":807299,"title":"","content":"I thought it would be interesting to ask because it says vampire drinking from demons gets glitches","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T03:47:36-08:00","id":807762,"title":"","content":"Well, the difference there is that a demon's cover is a patched-together facsimile of the systems the G-M uses. An angelic cover should theoretically be a perfect disguise, so it would simply register as ordinary human blood.<br /> <br /> Not that I'd recommend vampires drink from angels. They're a fair bit more powerful than demons, and don't take well to people interfering with their missions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3166,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","user":"Elfive","date":". 01-13-2016, 06:50 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T05:43:35-08:00","id":807799,"title":"","content":"Well Vampires can taste out a changeling - and their mien is also a very good illusion that still works after death. <br /> <br /> 1. In 2ed vampires became freakishly good supernatural perception via blood. I\u00b4d say that they should taste something off, but maybe they need an occult role to taste that this is supernatural. <br /> <br /> 2. Do Demons and Angels feels the Kiss? Yes demons are perfect liars, but how should one know how to react to a vampires bite?<br /> <br /> 3. I like the idea giving vampires a little bit of weirdness regarding thematically from the demons/angel they drank. not really as freaky when a vampire drinks from a magewerewolfchangeling. More subtle like a +1/2 bonus on subnterfuge rolls or crafts when handling mechanical things, etc.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Gamelines: Requiem, Lost, Awakening, Trinity Continuum: Aeon, some V5.<br /> Likes cheesecake (quark-based)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1305-maekkel","name":"maekkel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1305_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"206"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T06:33:42-08:00","id":807827,"title":"","content":"A cover isn't an illusion. It's a very much genuine human body that's basically been photoshopped into reality.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T07:16:00-08:00","id":807852,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elfive</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/807225-question-what-happens-if-a-vampire-drinks-angels-blood?p=807762#post807762\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, the difference there is that a demon's cover is a patched-together facsimile of the systems the G-M uses. An angelic cover should theoretically be a perfect disguise, so it would simply register as ordinary human blood.</div> </div> </div> </div> Angel covers are flawed as well; they're just as forced as a demons, even if their nature is vastly different. Glitches don't make sense, but something that feels like the Jacked In Condition might work.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elfive</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/807225-question-what-happens-if-a-vampire-drinks-angels-blood?p=807762#post807762\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not that I'd recommend vampires drink from angels. They're a fair bit more powerful than demons, and don't take well to people interfering with their missions.</div> </div> </div> </div> There are weak rank 1 angels as well as powerful Hunter angels. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>maekkel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/807225-question-what-happens-if-a-vampire-drinks-angels-blood?p=807799#post807799\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well Vampires can taste out a changeling - and their mien is also a very good illusion that still works after death.</div> </div> </div> </div> The Mask and Cover are on two different levels. The Mask is pretty nice way to cover up the inhuman bits. Covers are full disguises, complete down to blood type, personal scent, and more. The games cover different themes, so trying to say that they should be treated the same is a disservice to both.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> 1. In 2ed vampires became freakishly good supernatural perception via blood. I\u00b4d say that they should taste something off, but maybe they need an occult role to taste that this is supernatural. </div> </div> </div>Defeats the point of Cover. Cover is so good that it laughs at any attempt at supernatural perception. The vampire should walk away with a weird effect and wondering what the hells just happened. Which leads to investigation, which is the bane of demons and the GM.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> 2. Do Demons and Angels feels the Kiss? Yes demons are perfect liars, but how should one know how to react to a vampires bite? </div> </div> </div> It should be noted that all supernaturals -feel- the good parts when they're bit, irregardless if the vampire spends willpower. The problem is that supernaturals arne't incapacitated, dazed/mind wiped or gain Swooning by the Kiss without that willpower point. So, most likely what happens is that the vamp thinks the demon is human, and takes a bite as normal. The demon will feel good, but also feel that SOMONE JUST BIT THEIR NECK AND IS DRINKING THEIR BLOOD!!! Freaking out is a good sign you're not human, and cause for a Compromise check. Knowing not to freak out is an issue with the demon however.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> 3. I like the idea giving vampires a little bit of weirdness regarding thematically from the demons/angel they drank. not really as freaky when a vampire drinks from a magewerewolfchangeling. More subtle like a +1/2 bonus on subnterfuge rolls or crafts when handling mechanical things, etc. </div> </div> </div> Not all angels are crafters or liars. Each is custom built for the job at hand.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}